-A failed delivery is not retried.
+## Retries
+
+Each request has a 5 second timeout. A failed delivery is retried up to 3
+times (4 attempts total) with exponential backoff (1s, 2s, 4s between
+attempts). A 5xx response or a connection error is treated as retryable; a
+4xx response is treated as final and is not retried. Every attempt is
+recorded in `result.attempts` so a caller can see how many were made.
